                <P style="margin-left: 0pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000000; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; text-align: center; margin-right: 0pt; "><FONT style="font-weight: bold; "><B>NOTICE OF SPECIAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS<br>to be held on NOVEMBER 18, 2026</B></FONT></P>
                <P style="margin-left: 0pt; color: #000000; text-indent: 42.48pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; text-align: justify; margin-right: 0pt; "><FONT>TO BCB BANCORP SHAREHOLDERS:</FONT></P>
                <P style="margin-left: 0pt; color: #000000; text-indent: 42.48pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; text-align: justify; margin-right: 0pt; "><FONT>NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that BCB Bancorp, Inc. (the &#8220;</FONT><FONT style="text-decoration: underline; "><U>Company</U></FONT><FONT>&#8221;) will hold a special meeting of its shareholders (the &#8220;</FONT><FONT style="text-decoration: underline; "><U>Special Meeting</U></FONT><FONT>&#8221;) on:</FONT></P>
                <DIV style="margin-left: 0pt; color: #000000; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-right: 0pt; ">
                    <TABLE style="width: 637.2pt; margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse; ">
