                                <P style="margin-left: 84.96pt; color: #000000; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-right: 0pt; "><A href="#bcb_bancorp-def14aa305"><FONT>Section 1.</FONT></A></P>
                            </TD>
