                    <P style="margin-left: 0pt; color: #000000; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; margin-right: 0pt; "><FONT style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; ">13</FONT></P>
                    <!-- [if IE]></TD></TR></TABLE><![endif]-->
                </DIV>
            </DIV>
            <DIV style="border: 0pt; padding-top: 0pt; top: 42.48pt; left: 42.48pt; padding-left: 0pt; width: 637.2pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; position: absolute; padding-right: 0pt; height: 817.74pt; ">
                <P style="margin-left: 0pt; color: #000000; text-indent: 42.48pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify; margin-right: 0pt; "><FONT>IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the undersigned, being the incorporator hereinbefore named, has made, signed and acknowledged this Certificate of Incorporation this [&#8226;] day of [&#8226;], 2026.</FONT></P>
                <P style="margin-left: 254.88pt; color: #000000; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; text-align: justify; margin-right: 0pt; "><FONT>By:  _________________________________________</FONT></P>
                <P style="margin-left: 279.66pt; color: #000000; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-right: 0pt; "><FONT>Thomas M. O&#8217;Brien<br>Incorporator</FONT></P>
